WEBVTT

00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:01.347 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
想投几只股票，

00:00:01.484 --> 00:00:02.930 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
却不知道从哪看起？

00:00:03.372 --> 00:00:04.233 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
加入自选，

00:00:04.358 --> 00:00:05.620 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
打开信息导图。

00:00:05.929 --> 00:00:07.215 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
博主为什么看多？

00:00:07.668 --> 00:00:08.587 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
点到原话。

00:00:09.044 --> 00:00:10.215 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
习惯看K线？

00:00:10.661 --> 00:00:11.798 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
顺手就能看。

00:00:12.096 --> 00:00:13.462 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
再看佩洛西披露：

00:00:13.644 --> 00:00:14.436 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
交易记录，

00:00:14.561 --> 00:00:16.157 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
直接连到原始文件。

00:00:16.463 --> 00:00:17.725 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
每天相关消息，

00:00:17.907 --> 00:00:19.067 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
AI帮你梳理，

00:00:19.249 --> 00:00:19.731 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
留在你的

00:00:19.731 --> 00:00:20.913 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
投资时间线里。

00:00:21.196 --> 00:00:22.447 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
每天检查超跌，

00:00:22.606 --> 00:00:23.525 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
设好提醒。

00:00:23.978 --> 00:00:25.287 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
再回放两个例子。

00:00:25.596 --> 00:00:26.479 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
罗宾汉董事

00:00:26.479 --> 00:00:27.466 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
买入披露后，

00:00:27.672 --> 00:00:28.728 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
二十个交易日

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:29.634 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
涨了四成。

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:31.432 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
诺基亚合作消息后，

00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:33.094 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
回落到五块八毛七，

00:00:33.277 --> 00:00:34.597 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
后来到十块零三。

00:00:34.896 --> 00:00:35.860 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
少翻消息，

00:00:35.997 --> 00:00:37.271 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
把时间留给自己。

00:00:37.724 --> 00:00:39.572 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
Ducky，免费关注一只。
